sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Gin Server
    participant JS as JobStore
    participant D as BombardmentDriver
    participant P as FileParser
    participant T as JSONata Transformer
    participant BP as BatchProcessor
    participant LB as LoadBalancer
    participant RC as REST Client
    participant TGT as Target API

    U->>API: POST /v1/bombardment
    API->>API: validateBombardmentRequest()
    API->>JS: Create() new Job
    JS-->>API: Job (PENDING)
    API->>D: CreateBombardmentAsync(req, job)
    API-->>U: 201 JobSnapshot

    Note over D: Runs in goroutine with panic recovery

    D->>D: SetRunning()
    D->>P: CreateFileParser(parserContext)
    D->>T: CreateTransformer(transformerContext)
    D->>LB: CreateLoadBalancer(lbContext, client)

    D->>P: CreateRawDataStream()
    P-->>D: chan map[string]string

    Note over D,P: Counter goroutine wraps channel<br/>Samples SetTotal every 100 rows

    D->>BP: CreateProcessedBatchChannel(countedCh)

    loop Per Batch (size N)
        par Concurrent goroutines per item
            BP->>T: TransformRequest(rawData)
            T-->>BP: RestChannelRequest
            BP->>LB: Execute(request)
            LB->>RC: Execute(request, nextUrl)
            RC->>TGT: HTTP Request
            TGT-->>RC: HTTP Response
            RC-->>LB: RestChannelResponse
            LB-->>BP: ResponseSummary
        end
        Note over BP: wg.Wait() at batch boundary
    end

    BP-->>D: chan ResponseSummary

    opt ShouldStoreResponses
        D->>D: Write CSV rows (flush every 100)
    end

    D->>D: Complete() or Fail()

    U->>API: GET /v1/bombardment/:id
    API->>JS: Get(id)
    JS-->>API: JobSnapshot
    API-->>U: 200 JobSnapshot with progress
